{"sha":"ae0392cbdd9c1fdf0f42a5c73080db25212d2959","node_id":"C_kwDOAAkbnNoAKGFlMDM5MmNiZGQ5YzFmZGYwZjQyYTVjNzMwODBkYjI1MjEyZDI5NTk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Hasnaat Hussain","email":"hasnaat.hussain.2@gmail.com","date":"2026-07-07T12:57:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"Hasnaat Hussain","email":"hasnaat.hussain.2@gmail.com","date":"2026-07-07T12:57:41Z"},"message":"fix(tests): resolve collection crash under pytest 9.1\n\npytest 9.1 removed the internal 'notset' sentinel object from '_pytest.monkeypatch' (moving it to '_pytest.compat.NOTSET'). This causes a collection-time crash because the test suite imports 'notset' from the old location in conftest.py and test_cli.py.\n\nWe resolve this by falling back to import NOTSET from '_pytest.compat' first, then '_pytest.monkeypatch' for backward compatibility.","tree":{"sha":"6b9dd1cb81aa5dff67db4f51101c9340fe758141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/git/trees/6b9dd1cb81aa5dff67db4f51101c9340fe758141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/git/commits/ae0392cbdd9c1fdf0f42a5c73080db25212d2959","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/commits/ae0392cbdd9c1fdf0f42a5c73080db25212d2959","html_url":"https://github.com/pallets/flask/commit/ae0392cbdd9c1fdf0f42a5c73080db25212d2959","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/commits/ae0392cbdd9c1fdf0f42a5c73080db25212d2959/comments","author":{"login":"Hasnaathussain","id":110020083,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo7F8w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110020083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hasnaathussain","html_url":"https://github.com/Hasnaathussain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hasnaathussain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hasnaathussain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hasnaathussain/gists{/gist_id